  "description": "Why higher rates don’t immediately kill the bull market. And the recession resistant sector I’m buying before they catch up.",
  "body_html": "<p>Yesterday I received pushback when I said: “Raised rates are bullish for the stock market.”</p><p>Frankly, I expected it. Because I know what mainstream media is saying. I know what guru influencers are spouting online. They are largely incorrect. </p><p>Yes, increased rates will <em><strong>eventually</strong></em> catch up with the stock market, but it takes time. And during that time, whether it be months… or sometimes years… many assets will continue to rise. </p><p>This is one of many reasons my focus has remained on “recession resistant” assets, particularly silver miners (if gold goes up, so will silver, and so will silver miners; in which silver miners will have the largest % change.). We have also consistently seen strength in the health care sector. People continue to pay for health services… to stay alive… regardless the conditions of the economy. </p><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/flash-update-this-recession-resistant?r=4z8lgl\">Health care recession resistant stock I bought (click here)</a></h4><h4><a href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/i-found-3-stocks-hiding-among-389?r=4z8lgl\">Stocks with the most momentum are in the “Recession Resistant” sectors (click here)</a></h4><p>Regardless of rate hikes… despite the news…despite the Iran “War”… and ignoring so many negative narratives: we remain in a bull market. </p><p>Do not get me wrong, I do not think the bull market will go on FOREVER. There will come a day I flip bearish. But that is not today. There are still tons of opportunities available in the markets. Its going to take time to “cool the house” (inflation). </p><p>If you want to talk more, or ask me questions about some of the crazy things I say online, feel free to swing by the <strong><a href=\"https://open.substack.com/chat/posts/eb3f00e6-9f30-4570-8e48-c0bde66e4eec\">Main Chat</a> </strong>during market hours. </p><p>Have a great day, and thanks for stopping by! </p><h4>Please like ❤️ and re-stack 🔄 this post to help combat AI slop on Substack! </h4><div class=\"captioned-button-wrap\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/rate-hikes-are-here-im-still-buying?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"CaptionedButtonToDOM\"><div class=\"preamble\"><p class=\"cta-caption\">Know someone new to investing? Are they trembling from rate hikes? Send this post to them!</p></div><p class=\"button-wrapper\" data-attrs=\"{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/rate-hikes-are-here-im-still-buying?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;}\" data-component-name=\"ButtonCreateButton\"><a class=\"button primary\" href=\"https://tjstocks.substack.com/p/rate-hikes-are-here-im-still-buying?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share\"><span>Share</span></a></p></div>",
